; Gantry (issue #315): a factory crane. A MovingPlatform (#279) is the only
; floor across the 580 px chasm; it shuttles bank to bank in 3 s, stopping
; 20 px short of either lip. A Saw (#282) patrols vertically over its middle,
; and a Spikes row (#282) sits on each bank's inner lip. Spawns are on the
; banks, clear of every hazard.
